        "message": "feat(GB-001): greybox Oakhollow x3 strata and real budget validator\n\nThe manifest lists 3 strata, 12 capsule/box primitives and 3 physical\nvariant swaps derived from PR-S2 variant_id (baseline 0). Capsules and boxes\nare the only legal kinds; any mesh, texture, material or GLB field is a hard\nerror, not an ignored extra.\n\nvalidate-scene-budget.mjs replaced the P0-002 stub. --greybox exits 0 with\na deterministic FNV checksum; --parity exits 1 (WG-001 owns parity), no\nflag exits 1, and injecting a mesh field exits 1 naming the defect.\n\nGDD-CONSEQUENCE 0.4 (I9). No Babylon scene, blind-reviewer captures,\ncollision parity or art: WG-001 and P3-001 own those. GATE:P2 remains\nunsatisfied and no GPU/TPU is available (ND-012).\n\nAcceptance: greybox 0, negatives 1/1/1, verify 17/17, tracer green.\n\nAgent: level-designer\nTask: GB-001",
